<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - KB cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - KB cut.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamaichi Research Institute of Securities and Economics Inc said it downgraded KB Co Ltd to a &quot;2&quot; rating from its previous &quot;1&quot;.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;2&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees moving within 10 percentage points in either direction of the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index over the next six months.</p>
</text>
